<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<quiz>
  <question type="stack">
    <name>
      <text>Distinguishing permutations and combinations in real-life contexts</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>For each situation below, decide whether <b>order matters</b> (a permutation) or <b>order does not matter</b> (a combination). Select the correct classification from each dropdown list.</p>
<ol>
  <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;">{#q1#} &nbsp; [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]] [[feedback:prt1]]</li>
  <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;">{#q2#} &nbsp; [[input:ans2]] [[validation:ans2]] [[feedback:prt2]]</li>
  <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;">{#q3#} &nbsp; [[input:ans3]] [[validation:ans3]] [[feedback:prt3]]</li>
  <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;">{#q4#} &nbsp; [[input:ans4]] [[validation:ans4]] [[feedback:prt4]]</li>
  <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;">{#q5#} &nbsp; [[input:ans5]] [[validation:ans5]] [[feedback:prt5]]</li>
  <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;">{#q6#} &nbsp; [[input:ans6]] [[validation:ans6]] [[feedback:prt6]]</li>
  <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;">{#q7#} &nbsp; [[input:ans7]] [[validation:ans7]] [[feedback:prt7]]</li>
  <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;">{#q8#} &nbsp; [[input:ans8]] [[validation:ans8]] [[feedback:prt8]]</li>
</ol>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <generalfeedback format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><b>Worked Solution:</b></p>

<p>Use the <b>swap test</b>: ask yourself, <i>"If I swap two of the chosen items, do I get a different outcome?"</i></p>
<ul>
  <li>If <b>yes</b>, different arrangements or roles create distinct outcomes, so <b>order matters (permutation)</b>.</li>
  <li>If <b>no</b>, swapping gives the exact same group or pair, so <b>order does not matter (combination)</b>.</li>
</ul>

<p><b>Item-by-item breakdown:</b></p>
<ol>
  <li style="margin-bottom: 6px;">{#exp1#}</li>
  <li style="margin-bottom: 6px;">{#exp2#}</li>
  <li style="margin-bottom: 6px;">{#exp3#}</li>
  <li style="margin-bottom: 6px;">{#exp4#}</li>
  <li style="margin-bottom: 6px;">{#exp5#}</li>
  <li style="margin-bottom: 6px;">{#exp6#}</li>
  <li style="margin-bottom: 6px;">{#exp7#}</li>
  <li style="margin-bottom: 6px;">{#exp8#}</li>
</ol>]]></text>
    </generalfeedback>
